1:#!/bin/bash
2:#  score_selftest.sh <file holding the block> <good 33/33 log> <outdir>
3:#  #566: scores the ip30_abort gate block's scoring text (everything after the probe invocation, through its `fi',
4:#  extracted from the file named -- the text that ships) against the real 33/33 log and against doctored copies of it.
5:#  Every doctored case must red.  count/check/note mirror regress/lib.sh (grep -ac; exact compare; print).
6:#  Pass 1 (Astra, Grok) added n11-n15: a good log under a non-zero exit status, a duplicated and a malformed CONTROL
7:#  line, a duplicated DONE, and a REAL invocation of a probe file that does not exist.
